{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56514","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 三 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巍巍尊复高，飘飘何左顾。\n世人徒链丹，不识神仙路。\n衆石属坎宫，假名皆不悟。\n黑白既不知，流年亦虚度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}